      "content": "it's not just about being tired though. it's like... it's the realization that even if i find people who support me, the world out there doesn't care. it's just constant friction. it feels like i'm fighting a war that i was never meant to win. i just wonder if there's any point in even trying to fix it when the cost is just me constantly being broken.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
